WEBVTT

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:32.542
"Tell me where your father is or I will kill you."

00:03:32.542 --> 00:03:36.724
My father, hiding nearby, reveals himself,

00:03:36.724 --> 00:03:40.889
and was summarily taken to prison.

00:03:40.889 --> 00:03:44.625
Well, we survived, but democracy did not.

00:03:44.625 --> 00:03:47.137
Seven brutal years of dictatorship

00:03:47.137 --> 00:03:50.929
which we spent in exile.

00:03:50.929 --> 00:03:53.153
Now, today, our democracies are again

00:03:53.153 --> 00:03:55.432
facing a moment of truth.

00:03:55.432 --> 00:03:57.259
Let me tell you a story.

00:03:57.259 --> 00:03:59.543
Sunday evening,

00:03:59.543 --> 00:04:02.662
Brussels, April 2010.